+
+**Cancellation**: The withdrawal of an upcoming Visit from a Pet's record, after which no Visit remains. Relationships: A Cancellation applies to exactly one upcoming Visit; the clinic keeps no record of the Visit or of the Cancellation itself. Avoid: Deletion and Removal (both name the mechanism rather than what staff are doing), and "cancelled visit" — once a Visit is cancelled there is no Visit.
+
