+	/**
+	 * Reports whether this visit is still upcoming, which it is on the day of the visit
+	 * and on any day before it. The rule is deliberately one day wider than the booking
+	 * rule, which accepts a later day only: the record carries no time of day, so a visit
+	 * dated today may still be ahead.
